flowchart TD
    S["Script says what this turn<br/>should reveal"]
    G["Generator AI<br/>drafts the child line"]
    K["Quick checks<br/>sounds like a child?<br/>content mild enough?"]
    V["Reviewer AI<br/>right age? on script?<br/>not hinting at the answer?"]
    R["If a check or the reviewer says no:<br/>try again with the reason<br/>up to 3 times"]
    FB["After 3 failed tries:<br/>use the backup line from the script<br/>and flag it for a human"]
    OUT["Line is sent to the chatbot"]
    S --> G
    G --> K
    K --> V
    K --> R
    V --> R
    R --> G
    R --> FB
    V --> OUT
    FB --> OUT
